name": "scsh4.png", "id": "3601782913332521", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623111_3601782916665854_3066473161000110169_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CKVQKJBU5XAQ7kNvwFDv3h5&_nc_oc=AdqWG7BnxfbcJnWZxKZTdpEg2BL21Ijv8MyUPRPLOcpuwwEqIH33uWv2Gjrae-IUhTQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSysTnlpiHrN0OImzJQPVpfqbAKPG4N2RcJcAXF3hMMzQ&oe=6AF89387"}, {"file_name": "ASMBL_Island 1.png", "id": "1116431820840879", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619369_1116431824174212_3447739432138014736_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tCEIlPJ9Nd4Q7kNvwHWbzX6&_nc_oc=AdofsoPJdwyO9znBMtCh_XtsVgl7zyk9Vh7XyYbkMds4eK_h6U6hjGKiCKU4iGNLPgE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQk5XKrgHE7H-w6d3Et-QwyYEXuu3LkLlYX00bahv224w&oe=6AF883F9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImage.png", "id": "3027204224288051", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619382_3027204227621384_8045817710353431669_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R9AnTmNjNGMQ7kNvwGIHp4k&_nc_oc=AdqoWR8Yo25q7R8_eQOKBz1GuKyot5EewdUunOUbgDrxKQoca2O6sMC49L2kyx_B3Ro&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTXAbe0aDzP1uSQDCDUy3wbX1N9e4H_iswLsyRkz8U5fw&oe=6AF89CB6"}, "display_name": "ASMBL Demo", "keywords": ["Mech", "Plane", "Car", "Build", "Demo"], "long_description": "# Build. Program. Pilot. Compete.\n\nASMBL is a multiplayer VR sandbox where you can build anything from simple machines to massive, fully functional vehicles that you climb inside and drive around.\n\nTry out this free demo and see for yourself!\n\n# Build Without Limits.\n\nFrom minifigs to monuments, ASMBL gives you the tools to create a world of your own. Build practical machines that solve problems, elegant engineering marvels, or completely unnecessary contraptions that probably should never have been built.\n\nWith 300+ part types, 40+ materials, and an ever-growing collection of mechanical, electronic, and structural components, there is no single right way to build.\n\n# Create Your Own Avatar.\n\nWhy stop at machines? Build your own VR avatar and express yourself however you want. Create something recognizable, ridiculous, or completely unique\u2014and bring it with you into the world of ASMBL.\n\n# Features\n\n* 300+ buildable part types\n* 40+ unique materials\n* Motors, pistons, servos, wheels, wings, propellers, rockets, gyroscopes, suction cups, proximity sensors, and more\n* Machine guns, rocket launchers, blasters, missile launchers, and laser cannons\n* Game controllers, steering wheels, HOTAS, tank steering, and body motion control\n* Buildable VR avatars\n* Share creations with other players", "short_description": "Build. Program. Pilot. \nASMBL isn't just about creating machines; it's about stepping inside them. Build a vehicle and drive it. Build an aircraft and fly it. Build a spacecraft and launch it. Use steering wheels, game controllers, HOTAS joysticks, tank controls, or even your own body to operate your creations. Every machine exists in a fully simulated physics playground, allowing you to test, refine, break, rebuild, and push your designs to their limits."}]}, "developer_name": "Carbon Copy Labs LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://asmblvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://asmblvr.com/terms-condition", "publisher_name": "Carbon Copy Labs LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://asmblvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recomme